  Fuel, Plus, Save, Trash2, Edit2, Droplet, Filter, X, Calendar, Printer, AlertCircle, Users, ChevronDown, ChevronUp, MapPin, Clock, ClipboardList, ChevronLeft, ChevronRight, Loader2, DollarSign, Receipt, Package, RefreshCw, UserCheck
